OL,3,GNEWSAHeathrow and Gatwick among
OL,4,Aairports hit by air traffic control
OL,5,Aproblems
OL,6,
OL,7,FDepartures from a number of UK
OL,8,Fairports, including Heathrow and
OL,9,FGatwick, have been affected by a
OL,10,Ftechnical problem affecting the air
OL,11,Ftraffic control provider Nats.
OL,13,FAt Heathrow, departures were initially
OL,14,Fpaused around lunchtime. Traffic then
OL,15,Fresumed, before facing further
OL,16,Fstop-start disruption in the afternoon.
OL,17,FIncoming flights have been landing as
OL,18,Fnormal.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
