OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHeathrow and Gatwick among
OL,4,Aairports hit by air traffic control
OL,5,Aproblems
OL,6,
OL,7,FGatwick said it was currently being
OL,8,Faffected by the issue, along with other
OL,9,Fairports. East Midlands has also been
OL,10,Faffected by the issue, while Manchester
OL,11,FAirport warned that some departing
OL,12,Fflights could be delayed.
OL,14,FPassengers have been advised to contact
OL,15,Ftheir airlines to check the status of
OL,16,Ftheir flights.
